<quiz><question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Calculating Moments about an Arbitrary Constant from Frequency Table</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Calculate the first four moments about the arbitrary constant \((A = {@aa@})\) of the data given in the Table below
</p>
<p>
<table border="solid">
  <tr>
      <th width="50%", style="text-align:center">Class Interval</th>
       <th width="50%", style="text-align:center">frequency \((f_i)\)</th>
  </tr>
   <tr>
      <th width="50%", style="text-align:center">\({@a1@}-{@a2@}\)</th>
       <th width="50%", style="text-align:center">\({@f1@}\)</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
      <th width="50%", style="text-align:center">\({@a2@}-{@a3@}\)</th>
       <th width="50%", style="text-align:center">\({@f2@}\)</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
      <th width="50%", style="text-align:center">\({@a3@}-{@a4@}\)</th>
       <th width="50%", style="text-align:center">\({@f3@}\)</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
      <th width="50%", style="text-align:center">\({@a4@}-{@a5@}\)</th>
       <th width="50%", style="text-align:center">\({@f4@}\)</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
      <th width="50%", style="text-align:center">\({@a5@}-{@a6@}\)</th>
       <th width="50%", style="text-align:center">\({@f5@}\)</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
      <th width="50%", style="text-align:center">\({@a6@}-{@a7@}\)</th>
       <th width="50%", style="text-align:center">\({@f6@}\)</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
      <th width="50%", style="text-align:center">\({@a7@}-{@a8@}\)</th>
       <th width="50%", style="text-align:center">\({@f7@}\)</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
      <th width="50%", style="text-align:center">\({@a8@}-{@a9@}\)</th>
       <th width="50%", style="text-align:center">\({@f8@}\)</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
      <th width="50%", style="text-align:center">Total</th>
       <th width="50%", style="text-align:center">\({@total_f@}\)</th>
  </tr>
 </table>
</p>
<p>First moment about the point \(A={@aa@}\)</p>
<p>\(\mu'_1=\) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]][[feedback:prt1]]</p>
<p>Second moment about the point \(A\)</p>
<p>\(\mu'_2=\) [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]][[feedback:prt2]]</p>
<p>Third moment about the point \(A\)</p>
<p>\(\mu'_3=\) [[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]][[feedback:prt3]]</p>
<p>Fourth moment about the point \(A\)</p>
<p>\(\mu'_4=\) [[input:ans4]] [[validation:ans4]][[feedback:prt4]]</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
