<p>First moment about the point \(A={@aa@}\)</p>
<p>\(\displaystyle \mu'_1=\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^n f_i(X_i-A)^1=\frac{{@sum_fx@}}{{@total_f@}}={@sum_fx/total_f@} \implies \bar{X}=A+\mu'_1={@aa@}{@if (sum_fx/total_f)<0 then "-" else "+"@}{@abs(sum_fx/total_f)@}={@aa-(sum_fx/total_f)@}\)</p>
<p>Second moment about the point \(A\)</p>
<p>\(\displaystyle \mu'_2=\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^n f_i(X_i-A)^2=\frac{{@sum_fx1@}}{{@total_f@}}={@sum_fx1/total_f@}\)</p>
<p>Third moment about the point \(A\)</p>
<p>\(\displaystyle \mu'_3=\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^n f_i(X_i-A)^3=\frac{{@sum_fx2@}}{{@total_f@}}={@sum_fx2/total_f@}\)</p>
<p>Fourth moment about the point \(A\)</p>
<p>\(\displaystyle \mu'_4=\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^n f_i(X_i-A)^2=\frac{{@sum_fx3@}}{{@total_f@}}={@sum_fx3/total_f@}\)</p>]]></text>
